{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38943","headline":"喜从弟雪中远至有作 · 杜荀鹤","name":"喜从弟雪中远至有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深山大雪懒开门，门迳行踪自尔新。\n无酒御寒虽寡况，有书供读且资身。\n便均情爱同诸弟，莫更生疎似外人。\n昼短夜长须强学，学成贫亦胜他贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}